<p><!--


<div class="row">


<div class="col-lg-12">
		<img decoding="async" alt="June 12th Mayor Cogswell will be honoring vendors who have successfully grown their businesses in the The Charleston City Market" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/night-out-town.jpg" /></div>




<div class="col-lg-12"></div>




<div class="col-lg-4">


<h2><small>THURSDAY, June 12th</small>
A NIGHT OUT ON THE TOWN!</h2>




<h3 style="margin-top: 9px;">Ceremony with the honorable Mayor Cogswell</h3>


</div>




<div class="col-lg-8">


<p style="font-family: Open Sans, sans-serif;">Thursday Night, June 12th @ The Charleston City Market, Mayor Cogswell will join The Charleston City Market in celebrating the remarkable resilience of long-standing businesses and welcoming the innovative spirit of new businesses.</p>




<p style="font-family: Open Sans, sans-serif;">The CIty Market transforms into the Night Market @ 6:30 pm and will be a lively celebration with Mayor Cogswell, local businesses, live music, and plenty of artisan goods!</p>



</div>


</div>





<hr />





<div class="row">


<div class="col-md-8">


<p style="font-family: Open Sans, sans-serif;">Mayor Cogswell will be honoring vendors who have successfully grown their businesses in the market for 30, 40, or 50 years, celebrating their remarkable achievements and dedication to their local, small businesses. Furthermore, a ceremony will be held to welcome new vendors who are introducing their own handmade products, embodying the entrepreneurial spirit. As Jimmy Buffet so eloquently put it, "I'm just a simple guy, I'm just trying to make it."</p>




<p style="font-family: Open Sans, sans-serif;">A tropical vibe will be on site with music that will pay homage to Jimmy Buffet and some of everyone's most cherished songs.</p>


For more information, contact <a href="mailto:chasnightmarket@gmail.com">chasnightmarket@gmail.com</a>.

</div>




<div class="col-md-4">
		<img decoding="async" style="width: 100%;" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Thursday-June-12th-@-The-Charleston-City.gif"/></div>


</div>


--></p>
<!--WELCOME-->
<h1 style="text-align: center" class="big-title">We are Open daily 9:30-5:00 pm.</h1>
<div class="col-md-12 white-bg">	
	<div class="row">
		<div class="col-md-12">
			<h2></h2>
			<p><figure><img decoding="async" src="https://imgssl.constantcontact.com/letters/images/CPE-PT18353/Divider.png" /></figure>
<p><big><br />
Welcome! The <strong>Charleston City Market</strong> is one of America’s oldest public markets and South Carolina’s number one most visited attraction. For generations, the Charleston City Market has been a place where local artisans and craftspeople, residents, and visitors come together. Today, our iconic Great Hall and historic open-air sheds remain one of Charleston’s most recognizable and beloved shopping destinations.</big></p>
<p><big>Located in the heart of historic downtown Charleston, <strong>the Market stretches across four city blocks and is home to more than 300 vendors</strong> offering an extraordinary variety of locally made art, crafts, food, gifts, and souvenirs. We are especially proud of our <strong>authentic local sweetgrass basket weavers</strong>, whose distinctive handmade baskets represent an important and enduring tradition of Charleston’s Gullah culture.</big></p>
<p><big><strong>Open every day except December 25</strong>, the Charleston City Market welcomes millions of visitors each year.<br />
</big></p>
<figure><img decoding="async" src="https://imgssl.constantcontact.com/letters/images/CPE-PT18353/Divider.png" /></figure>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div></div>
<div></div>
<div class="text-center">
<figure><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-1536" src="https://www.thecharlestoncitymarket.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_1978-225x300.jpg" alt="Charleston Mayor William Cogswell presents a Certified Local 100% Made in Charleston Award to vendors at the Charleston City Market" width="225" height="300" srcset="https://www.thecharlestoncitymarket.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_1978-225x300.jpg 225w, https://www.thecharlestoncitymarket.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_1978-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://www.thecharlestoncitymarket.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_1978-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://www.thecharlestoncitymarket.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_1978-1536x2048.jpg 1536w, https://www.thecharlestoncitymarket.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_1978-scaled.jpg 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px" /></figure>
<div></div>
<h2 style="color: #284fa1; font-size: 48px;"><strong>Celebrate with Us!</strong></h2>
<div></div>
<p style="color: #284fa1;"><big>On <strong>Thursday, October 15th</strong>, Charleston Mayor William Cogswell will recognize a wide array of talented local vendors for their contributions to the success and enduring character of Charleston’s Historic City Market. Join us as Mayor Cogswell presents “Certified Authentic Handmade in Charleston” plaques to the newest members of the Night Market’s exclusive group of artisans who create their own one-of-a-kind, handmade products.</big></p>
<p style="color: #284fa1;"><big>Festivities begin at 6:30 pm &amp; Awards presentation at 7 pm</big></p>
<div></div>
<figure><img decoding="async" src="https://imgssl.constantcontact.com/letters/images/CPE-PT18353/Divider.png" /></figure>
</div>
<p><!--

<span data-mce-type="bookmark" style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;" class="mce_SELRES_start"></span><strong>The Charleston City Market is Accepting Night Market Applications! Applications will be accepted 01.01.2026 -  02.15.2026 at 1 pm</strong>
We are excited to have you apply for the Night Market! We are always looking for amazing new artists, artisans, crafters and food vendors.


<p style="margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px;"><a class="btn-layout" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeg-ieU2WEXva6jNKv6lqHH_0GSqaHc6KbfUueVtmfdH49RFw/viewform" target="_blank">2026 Night Market Vendor Application</a></p>


--></p>
<p><!--About the Night Market--><br />
<!--


<h3>About the Night Market</h3>


We are the largest art market in the Southeast and have won Charleston's choice for Local Art in 2018, 2019, 2020,  2021, 2022, 2023. 2024 & 2025.  The Night Market began as an Artisan/Hand Crafted only market in 2013, and now has over 200 various artists represented. This dynamic and diverse group has become an integral part of the Charleston City Market.

The Night Market is situated between Church Street and East Bay Street, operating every Friday and Saturday evening from 6:30 PM to 10:30 PM, commencing March 14, 2026, and concluding in December 2026. Centrally located in downtown Charleston, within the iconic City Market, the Night Market offers an opportunity to discover high-quality, unique, local, and handcrafted items, establishing itself as one of the largest and most diverse artisan markets, spanning three blocks. We are pleased that you have chosen to apply for the Night Market. Applications for the upcoming season will be accepted exclusively January1, 2026 -  February 15, 2026 @ 1pm. Access to the application form requires a Google account. No walk-in applications will be accepted. We do not accept applications for the Day Market, as the Night Market serves as the pathway to becoming a Day Market vendor. Upon acceptance to the Night Market, there may be opportunities to participate in the Day Market at the renowned Charleston City Market.

We are currently <strong>not</strong> accepting applications for Jewelry, Candles, CBD or Essential Oils, Ice Cream or Italian Ice, printed mugs, baseball caps, charcuterie boards, ornaments.

--></p>
